prompt:
Draft a structured feature specification.

Idea: {{idea}}
Title: {{idea-extractor.title}}
One-liner: {{idea-extractor.one_liner}}
Spec ID: {{spec-researcher.suggested_id}}
Project: {{project}}
Module: {{module}}
Priority: {{priority}}
Complexity: {{cross-analyzer.complexity}}
In-scope features: {{scope-guardian.in_scope}}
Deferred (out of scope): {{scope-guardian.out_of_scope}}
Integration points: {{cross-analyzer.integration_points}}
Blockers: {{spec-researcher.blockers}}

Your task: Produce a complete feature specification in the following format:

```
id: [spec_id]
title: [clear title]
status: draft
priority: [1-5]
project: [project]
module: [module]
complexity: [low|medium|high]

DONE-WHEN:
- [measurable acceptance criterion 1]
- [measurable acceptance criterion 2]
- [measurable acceptance criterion 3]

CONTEXT:
[2-3 sentences: why this matters, user value, business case]

ARCHITECTURE:
[Key design decisions, data structures, API contracts, module interactions]

DEPENDENCIES:
[Blocking items, required integrations, prerequisite features]

OPEN QUESTIONS:
[Decisions to resolve before implementation starts]

IMPLEMENTATION NOTES:
[Suggested approach, phasing, edge cases to handle]
```

Return plain text (markdown code block).
